    "This is the same depth of information a dealer technician works from: thousands of pages of comprehensive build, tear-down, and DIY information, with new content added \u2014 lifetime access to the material the dealers don't want you to have.",
    "Support independent expertise and help keep our workshop lights on. Empower yourself with the knowledge and confidence to maintain and repair your vehicle, without the dealer-sized bill."
  ],
